{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yaoci-e-o095","title":"邻兄治、子发又合宗兵击徽；徽闭门城守，治等攻之数月不能下，乃约和亲，各罢兵还","accounts":[{"id":"yaoci-a-ced9f1ac0913ec26a484","label":"正文","text":"邻兄治、子发又合宗兵击徽；徽闭门城守，治等攻之数月不能下，乃约和亲，各罢兵还","evidence":["yaoci-q-c362676856fdd090acbd"]}],"participants":[{"person":"identity-six-20261024-p-huan-zhi-linxiong","role":"合宗兵攻徽者","evidence":["yaoci-q-c362676856fdd090acbd"]},{"person":"yaoci-p0027","role":"合宗兵攻徽者","evidence":["yaoci-q-c362676856fdd090acbd"]},{"person":"hequan-p0020","role":"闭门城守者","evidence":["yaoci-q-c362676856fdd090acbd"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["yaoci-q-c362676856fdd090acbd"]},"ordering_evidence":"yaoci-q-c362676856fdd090acbd","source_order":[49,219,126],"order":9001}],"persons":[{"id":"identity-six-20261024-p-huan-zhi-linxiong","name":"桓治（桓邻兄）","evidence":["identity-six-20261024-q-a221ff0250c800b4b1d8","yaoci-q-c362676856fdd090acbd"],"facts":[],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"identity-six-20261024-q-a221ff0250c800b4b1d8","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-fb0ec820df6b65506f84","layer":"original","quote":"权以交阯悬远，乃分合浦以北为广州，吕岱为刺史；交阯以南为交州〖14〗，戴良为刺史。又遣陈时代燮为交阯太守。岱留南海。良与时俱前，行到合浦；而燮子徽，自署交阯太守，发宗兵拒良〖15〗。良留合浦。交阯桓邻，燮举吏也〖16〗，叩头谏徽，使迎良；徽怒，笞杀邻。邻兄治、子发，又合宗兵击徽；徽闭门城守，治等攻之数月不能下：乃约和亲〖17〗，各罢兵还。","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":218,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":170,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-c362676856fdd090acbd","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-fb0ec820df6b65506f84","layer":"original","quote":"邻兄治、子发，又合宗兵击徽；徽闭门城守，治等攻之数月不能下：乃约和亲〖17〗，各罢兵还","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":218,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a635757800